ProtocolFeeCollector::setMinimumRewardAmount
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new minimum reward amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorInvalidMinimumRewardAmount
    ├── when new minimum reward amount equals the current value
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    └── when new minimum reward amount is nonzero and different
        ├── it should update minimumRewardAmount
        └── it should emit MinimumRewardAmountUpdated
